@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
hide circle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
title Default hourly rates: responsibilities

class StudentCommands {
  +execute(input) : String
}
class LessonCommands {
  +execute(input) : String
}
class TutorLedgerData {
  +addStudent(..., subjects, rate) : Student
  +replaceStudent(student)
  +addLesson(..., fee, duration) : Lesson
}
class Student {
  -defaultHourlyRate : BigDecimal [0..1]
  +withDefaultHourlyRate(rate) : Student
  +withDetails(...) : Student
}
class Lesson {
  -studentId : String
  -fee : BigDecimal
  -durationMinutes : int
  +withDurationMinutes(minutes) : Lesson
}
class Storage {
  +encode(data) : String
  +decode(lines) : LoadResult
}
StudentCommands --> TutorLedgerData : updates profiles
LessonCommands --> TutorLedgerData : schedules lessons
TutorLedgerData "1" *--> "0..*" Student : stores
TutorLedgerData "1" *--> "0..*" Lesson : stores
Storage ..> TutorLedgerData : saves / rebuilds
note bottom of Lesson
  studentId identifies the student by ID;
  it is not a stored Student object reference.
  The fee is a saved total.
  It is not a live reference to the rate.
end note
@enduml
